implementationPlan.description:
Step 1: Add SafetyChecker field to SagaManager

In `saga.go`, add `safety SafetyChecker` field to SagaManager struct. Add builder method:
```go
func (s *SagaManager) WithSafety(sc SafetyChecker) *SagaManager {
    if s == nil { return s }
    s.safety = sc
    return s
}
```
Wire it in engine setup (wherever SagaManager is created and passed to Engine).
